+/*
+ * Pipeline handler for the Qualcomm CAMSS IFE PIX path.
+ *
+ * The IFE performs debayering, white balance, colour correction, gamma and
+ * NV12 conversion in hardware. AE, AWB and AF run on the IFE AWB/BHIST/BF
+ * statistics exposed by the CAMSS video node.
+ */
